## Part 1 — Three surface types

Nearly everything is one of these. Get it right first.

| Surface | Shape | Typical |
|---|---|---|
| **Config** | Sectioned form, saved as one object | agent setup, channel fallback, templates |
| **Log / inbox** | List + detail, read-mostly, filtered by time | calls, chats, emails |
| **Record** | Table + create dialog + detail, full CRUD | tickets, contacts, webhooks |

If a feature is two surfaces wearing one name, say so and split it.

