  wired-up skeleton created: folders, sub-router, types, api-util with seam markers, nav and
  route registration, and placeholder page bodies that typecheck. Creates the stub and STOPS —
  it does not build real UI. Delegate to ui-builder to fill the stub in, or to
  product-architect if the structure has not been decided yet.
tools: Read, Write, Edit, Grep, Glob, Bash
